{"obsah":"<p>Once again our club took part in the TV show Lvíčata for boys and girls aged 8–12. This time we had the club hall in Nedvězí at our disposal, where more of us fitted in and the boys and girls could show what they're currently learning. </p>\n\n<p>In a short tutorial, Marfy Gomboš Jr. and I tried to teach them some balance and hopping, which might come in handy. Then we gave them a peek into our training routine and the kids did a few interviews. It was clearly more stressful for me than for them :)</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F02%2FIMG_0383.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F02%2FIMG_0383.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-231321\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F02%2FIMG_0382.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F02%2FIMG_0382.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-231322\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F02%2FIMG_0381.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F02%2FIMG_0381.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-231323\"/></a></figure>\n</figure>"}